# Line endings.
#
# Shell scripts must keep LF. They are executed by bash under WSL/Linux, and a
# CRLF ending makes bash fail with:  $'': command not found
# `eol=lf` overrides core.autocrlf=true, which Windows checkouts otherwise use.
*.sh      text eol=lf

# Everything else normalises to LF in the repository.
*         text=auto
